Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

libbpf — https://github.com/libbpf/libbpf
    Vendored. LGPL-2.1 OR BSD-2-Clause.

bpftool — https://github.com/libbpf/bpftool
    Vendored, used at build time to generate skeletons and vmlinux.h.

BCC sslsniff — https://github.com/iovisor/bcc
    The probe approach and original sslsniff implementation are derived from
    BCC's Apache-2.0-licensed tool of the same name.

AgentSight — https://github.com/eunomia-bpf/agentsight
    AgentSight carries the same BCC/eBPF TLS-capture lineage and is the runtime
    capture implementation consumed by RailMon. It is named here for lineage;
    AgentSight source is not vendored in this repository.
